Z||000000||Cheever3000||08-15-2001||09:31 PM||||I'm a computer operator, and one of my tasks is to print the company's a/p checks.  Maybe I'm having a blonde moment, but would someone explain to me why a company would <I>pay itself</I>?  I know it's legit, cause I've seen it at all my employers.  I just don't understand what purpose it serves.<BR>||||reg||5
